        115.38463592529297,
        527.4313354492188,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "Passive case-finding:  Patient-initiated pathway to TB diagnosis involving a person with TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4255981445312,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "who experiences symptoms that they recognize as serious; the person having access to and seeking",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.626220703125,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "care, and presenting spontaneously at an appropriate health facility; a health worker correctly assessing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
