      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.4345092773438,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "that the person fulfils the criteria for presumptive TB; and successful use of a diagnostic algorithm",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        321.0478820800781,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "with sufficient sensitivity and specificity to diagnose TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.88873291015625,
        527.3543701171875,
        204.4417266845703
      ],
      "text": "People who use drugs:  People who engage in the harmful or hazardous use of psychoactive",
