      "size": 10.94737434387207,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.8065185546875,
        524.410400390625,
        274.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "treated people may have been treated with a first-line regimen for drug-susceptible TB or a second-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.00653076171875,
        241.9560089111328,
        287.4495544433594
      ],
      "text": "line regimen for drug-resistant forms.",
