      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.60040283203125,
        527.4174194335938,
        309.1534118652344
      ],
      "text": "Programmatic management of tuberculosis preventive treatment:  All coordinated activities by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.910400390625,
        527.0938110351562,
        322.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "public and private health caregivers and the community aimed at scaling up TB preventive treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995698928833008,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.11041259765625,
        174.83309936523438,
        335.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "to people who need it.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.70440673828125,
        527.4776000976562,
        357.2574157714844
      ],
      "text": "Pulmonary tuberculosis (PTB) (classification):  Any bacteriologically confirmed or clinically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.014404296875,
        527.0917358398438,
        370.4574279785156
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed case of TB involving the lung parenchyma or the tracheobronchial tree, including tuberculous",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.21429443359375,
        527.4133911132812,
        383.6573181152344
      ],
      "text": "intrathoracic lymphadenopathy (mediastinal and/or hilar), without radiographic abnormalities in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.4143981933594,
        527.3800659179688,
        396.857421875
      ],
      "text": "lungs.  Miliary TB is classified as PTB because there are lesions in the lungs. A person with both PTB  10",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.6144104003906,
        339.7668151855469,
        410.05743408203125
      ],
      "text": "and extrapulmonary TB should be classified as having PTB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.5242919921875,
        527.3956909179688,
        431.7613220214844
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium tuberculosis Rifampicin-resistant tuberculosis (RR-TB):  TB caused by   strains",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        430.518310546875,
        527.1681518554688,
        444.9613342285156
      ],
      "text": "resistant to rifampicin. These strains may be susceptible or resistant to isoniazid (i.e. MDR-TB) or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        443.7182922363281,
        527.4388427734375,
        458.16131591796875
      ],
      "text": "resistant to other first-line or second-line TB medicines. In these guidelines and elsewhere, MDR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        456.9183044433594,
        527.392822265625,
        471.361328125
      ],
      "text": "and RR-TB cases are often grouped together as MDR/RR-TB and are eligible for treatment with an",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        470.1183166503906,
        152.85098266601562,
        484.56134033203125
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        489.0281982421875,
        527.40869140625,
        506.2652282714844
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium tuberculosis  Rifampicin-susceptible, isoniazid-resistant tuberculosis:  TB caused by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.953451156616211,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        505.022216796875,
        332.5314025878906,
        519.4652099609375
      ],
      "text": "strains resistant to isoniazid and susceptible to rifampicin.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        526.6162109375,
        527.3292236328125,
        541.169189453125
      ],
      "text": "Serious adverse event:  Adverse event that can lead to death or a life-threatening experience,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        539.9262084960938,
        527.1410522460938,
        554.3692016601562
      ],
      "text": "to hospitalization or prolongation of hospitalization, to persistent or significant disability, or to a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        553.126220703125,
        527.415771484375,
        567.5692138671875
      ],
      "text": "congenital anomaly. Serious adverse events that do not immediately result in one of these outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        566.326171875,
        527.3905029296875,
        580.7691650390625
      ],
      "text": "but that require an intervention to prevent such an outcome from happening are included. Serious",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        579.5261840820312,
        527.3882446289062,
        593.9691772460938
      ],
      "text": "adverse events may require a drastic intervention, such as termination of the medicine suspected of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        592.7261962890625,
        185.0975799560547,
        607.169189453125
      ],
      "text": "having caused the event.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        614.3201293945312,
        524.4180908203125,
        628.8731079101562
      ],
      "text": "Severe acute malnutrition:  Presence of oedema of both feet or severe wasting (weight-for-height/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        627.630126953125,
        524.4083251953125,
        642.0731201171875
      ],
      "text": "length less than −3 standard deviations/Z-scores or mid-upper arm circumference less than 115 mm). 11",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.946269035339355,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.2239990234375,
        527.5211791992188,
        663.7769775390625
      ],
      "text": "Severe extrapulmonary tuberculosis:  Presence of miliary (disseminated) TB or TB meningitis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        662.5341186523438,
        527.572998046875,
        676.9771118164062
      ],
      "text": "In children and young adolescents aged under 15 years, extrapulmonary forms of disease other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        675.734130859375,
        527.1640625,
        690.1771240234375
      ],
      "text": "than lymphadenopathy (peripheral nodes or isolated mediastinal mass without compression) are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        688.93408203125,
        183.1317901611328,
        703.3770751953125
      ],
      "text": "considered to be severe.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        727.8373413085938,
        522.5365600585938,
        741.541259765625
      ],
      "text": "Following a WHO expert consultation in September 2021, intrathoracic lymph node TB is now classified as pulmonary TB in children. 10",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
